VALUES (27270, 'tt0090630', NULL, 'America 3000', 'America 3000', 'movie', 1986, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7RwuEJ5Xho0Bsfj3oleZHntEPHC.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vj7kKjbgywk4lK9rLZteKaDB1hB.jpg', '900 years after a nuclear war in the USA, mankind is back to the stone ages. Amazon women rule the tribes, while the men are weak and dumb - either kept as slaves or living wild as animals. Only Korvis and a friend are intelligent enough to flee and found a tribe of their own. Will they manage to teach the women to love men again?', NULL, NULL, 1.0933, 4.1, 0, 1.02, '2026-11-28 04:11:46', '2026-11-28 04:11:46')
