VALUES (370964, 'tt4057376', NULL, 'I Am Dragon', 'Он - дракон', 'movie', 2015, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/9R9mwkXs0W78WMzh4M1yFP7v7RP.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/68chxvkKe8Zty1MNY1cCoBAKWs1.jpg', 'In the midst of the wedding princess Miroslava is kidnapped by a dragon and carried away into his castle on the remote island. Mira left everything behind in the past - family, friends and groom. Now the only things she had were a stone cage and a mysterious young man named Arman ... but who is he and what is he doing on that island? Miroslava will know the truth too late: loving a dragon will reveal the bitter truth - love is scary.', NULL, NULL, 3.4519, 7.208, 0, 10.535, '2026-08-03 14:31:56', '2026-11-28 04:11:46')
