VALUES (18011, 'tt0209095', NULL, 'Leprechaun in the Hood', 'Leprechaun in the Hood', 'movie', 2000, 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/lCRwtuxnJWkZ04gwtfYF9h1GUkl.jpg', 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sChPC8EozCIqmduXgZEV6ie8swD.jpg', 'When Butch, Postmaster P, and Stray Bullet loot the local hip-hop mogul''s studio to fund their demo album, the threesome unwittingly ends up with the secret of Mack Daddy''s success: a magical flute. Their gigs instantly turn golden but a blood-thristy Leprechaun and an angry Mack Daddy are hot on their trail, leaving a wake of destruction tainted by politically incorrect limericks.', NULL, NULL, 2.7837, 4.832, 0, 6.47000000000000064e+00, '2026-09-17 03:31:35', '2026-11-28 04:11:46')
